1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 14=

8
00:00:47,399 --> 00:00:48,439
I disperse your powers

9
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,219
to make you a mortal.

10
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:54,500
My powers!

11
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:55,920
My Golden Core!

12
00:00:56,740 --> 00:00:57,740
Any problem?

13
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:01,500
(He stripped all my powers
with a single word.)

14
00:01:02,039 --> 00:01:04,040
(What a monster he is!)

15
00:01:07,340 --> 00:01:09,840
No, not at all.

16
00:01:10,859 --> 00:01:11,859
Very well.

17
00:01:11,879 --> 00:01:14,180
From now on, you will stay by my side

18
00:01:14,340 --> 00:01:15,439
as a maid.

19
00:01:15,879 --> 00:01:16,879
What do you think?

20
00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:19,359
Does it matter?

21
00:01:19,819 --> 00:01:21,680
You've destroyed my Golden Core,

22
00:01:22,599 --> 00:01:25,379
and I can only be a useless trash now.

23
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:28,540
Rebirth through destruction.

24
00:01:29,219 --> 00:01:30,239
Don't you know that?

25
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,760
(Right! He stripped my powers
with a single word.)

26
00:01:35,159 --> 00:01:36,159
(That means he...)

27
00:01:36,879 --> 00:01:39,060
I-I'm willing to be your maid.

28
00:01:40,739 --> 00:01:43,299
Good. Since you're now my maid,

29
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,680
you're one of us.

30
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,000
I won't mistreat you.

31
00:01:46,180 --> 00:01:48,959
Tell me, what technique do you practice?

32
00:01:49,939 --> 00:01:51,079
Nothing special.

33
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:54,780
Just the Earth-grade technique
from the secret manual of Zixia Sect,

34
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:56,739
called Zixia Mantian.

35
00:01:57,299 --> 00:01:59,659
That's something special.

36
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:01,019
Of course.

37
00:02:01,180 --> 00:02:02,640
That's the world's top...

38
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,640
Trash.

39
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:04,920
You!

40
00:02:11,340 --> 00:02:13,639
T-This is a Divine-grade technique!

41
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,740
Why do you have it?

42
00:02:16,580 --> 00:02:19,120
You asked too many questions.

43
00:02:21,139 --> 00:02:22,139
Impossible.

44
00:02:22,479 --> 00:02:25,979
You just gave me
a Divine-grade technique like that?

45
00:02:26,139 --> 00:02:27,139
Of course.

46
00:02:27,259 --> 00:02:29,539
Like I said, you're one of us now.

47
00:02:29,659 --> 00:02:30,659
This is what mortals...

48
00:02:30,659 --> 00:02:33,240
No, it's the Divine-grade technique
even True Immortals dream of.

49
00:02:33,580 --> 00:02:34,580
You're lying.

50
00:02:34,580 --> 00:02:35,580
This can't be real.

51
00:02:36,419 --> 00:02:37,500
Whether it's real or not,

52
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:40,759
why don't you just try it once?

53
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:52,639
I just tried once,

54
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,960
and my Golden Core cultivation is back.

55
00:02:55,340 --> 00:02:58,259
This really is a Divine-grade technique!

56
00:02:59,639 --> 00:03:01,500
And you gave it to me just like that?

57
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:03,800
Look at you, so ignorant.

58
00:03:04,199 --> 00:03:06,039
Do you know what chaos this would cause

59
00:03:06,039 --> 00:03:07,699
if it fell into the Cultivation World?

60
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,900
Yet you gave it to me like this?

61
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,180
Is it possible

62
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:16,900
that this Divine-grade technique
means nothing special to me?

63
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:19,919
What cultivation stage
are you actually at?

64
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:23,080
The Mahayana is the peak cultivation
stage in the mortal realm.

65
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:26,060
Are you at the Mahayana stage?

66
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,580
Just do your job as a maid.

67
00:03:28,159 --> 00:03:29,159
I shall reward you well.

68
00:03:33,599 --> 00:03:35,740
I am Zhang Daozhen. Greetings, Master.

69
00:03:36,759 --> 00:03:37,759
Greetings, Madam.

70
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,280
Ergou,

71
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:45,840
you're a man of honor.

72
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:46,840
I was right about you.

73
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:48,099
I only did what I should.

74
00:03:49,180 --> 00:03:50,879
By the way, Dong,

75
00:03:50,879 --> 00:03:51,960
when I gave out porridge,

76
00:03:52,219 --> 00:03:54,520
I met the magistrate's daughter.

77
00:03:55,319 --> 00:03:57,259
We hit it off right away.

78
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:59,500
We'll have a wedding soon!

79
00:04:00,159 --> 00:04:01,319
(Puppet, hidden blade.)

80
00:04:01,479 --> 00:04:02,479
(Vermilion Bird, knife in beak.)

81
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:03,800
(A sign of a lost mind.)

82
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,919
Why would the magistrate's daughter
fall for you?

83
00:04:10,439 --> 00:04:13,039
She said I'm pure and kind.

84
00:04:13,419 --> 00:04:14,419
A nice man.

85
00:04:15,040 --> 00:04:17,459
You really are pure.

86
00:04:26,959 --> 00:04:28,240
Remember the pouch from me?

87
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,839
Keep it safe.

88
00:04:30,019 --> 00:04:32,040
It can save your life in a crisis.

89
00:04:35,699 --> 00:04:37,699
Dong!

90
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,000
Dong!

91
00:04:40,259 --> 00:04:41,259
What is it, Wan'er?

92
00:04:41,259 --> 00:04:43,240
Her Majesty was taken
by Lord Duan's men.

93
00:04:43,439 --> 00:04:45,639
Her Majesty? Who do you mean?

94
00:04:47,420 --> 00:04:49,699
Xi Yun, one of us.

95
00:04:49,980 --> 00:04:52,699
She's actually the Empress Chu Yunxi.

96
00:04:55,459 --> 00:04:57,459
Dong, is this true?

97
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,759
That's unbelievable!

98
00:04:59,060 --> 00:05:00,060
It's true.

99
00:05:00,259 --> 00:05:02,040
Lord Duan and Prime Minister
are in cahoots.

100
00:05:03,139 --> 00:05:04,139
Her Majesty is in danger.

101
00:05:04,220 --> 00:05:05,680
Dong, you have to save her.

102
00:05:07,259 --> 00:05:08,360
The Ziwei Star fades.

103
00:05:08,839 --> 00:05:10,120
The Emperor Star falls into the deep.

104
00:05:10,300 --> 00:05:11,319
The White Tiger, corpse in jaws.

105
00:05:11,860 --> 00:05:12,860
The Dragon, trapped in the shallows.

106
00:05:13,519 --> 00:05:14,879
It is a fated prison tribulation.

107
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,639
She is the chosen one.

108
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:20,399
If I forcefully alter her fate,

109
00:05:21,339 --> 00:05:24,759
I might draw the attention
of mysterious beings.

110
00:05:25,699 --> 00:05:30,079
You mean,
Her Majesty is unlikely to survive this?

111
00:05:30,379 --> 00:05:31,379
This...

112
00:05:32,759 --> 00:05:33,899
Heaven's way holds forty-nine,

113
00:05:34,220 --> 00:05:35,259
leaving one variable.

114
00:05:35,620 --> 00:05:36,620
Even in a dead end,

115
00:05:36,699 --> 00:05:37,860
there is still hope.

116
00:05:38,660 --> 00:05:40,079
I will bide my time and act.

117
00:05:40,639 --> 00:05:41,639
(What a poser!)

118
00:05:41,660 --> 00:05:42,860
(He can't change fate,)

119
00:05:42,860 --> 00:05:44,019
(so he's making up nonsense.)

120
00:05:44,199 --> 00:05:45,240
(He'll be exposed soon.)

121
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:47,699
Hey, you'd better believe it.

122
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:50,060
You have a tribulation
coming up soon too.

123
00:05:51,579 --> 00:05:53,720
If you say so, then there must be.

124
00:05:55,939 --> 00:05:57,339
(Meeting you is my tribulation.)

125
00:05:57,779 --> 00:05:59,660
(I'll find the chance
to contact Ancestor.)

126
00:05:59,759 --> 00:06:01,779
(His cultivation is at the peak.)

127
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,399
(I'm sure you'll suffer.)

128
00:06:05,579 --> 00:06:06,579
(Time waits for no one.)

129
00:06:07,139 --> 00:06:09,000
(I must break through
the Golden Immortal stage soon.)

130
00:06:23,300 --> 00:06:24,300
My lord,

131
00:06:24,959 --> 00:06:26,839
why did you stop before we even started?

132
00:06:28,259 --> 00:06:29,480
My body just can't keep up.

133
00:06:32,819 --> 00:06:34,740
(If not for Father's promotion,)

134
00:06:35,220 --> 00:06:37,439
(why would I serve
a useless old fool like you?)

135
00:06:39,639 --> 00:06:40,759
Don't worry.

136
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,759
Once the sorcerer casts the spell

137
00:06:43,259 --> 00:06:45,500
and transplants Ergou's Pure Heart
into you tomorrow,

138
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:48,300
you'll surely regain your vigor.

139
00:06:49,100 --> 00:06:51,100
Right!

140
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:53,759
Once I get that heart,

141
00:06:54,819 --> 00:06:57,779
I'll make sure your father
becomes governor.

142
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,600
You despicable couple!

143
00:07:02,339 --> 00:07:03,339
Darling?

144
00:07:04,579 --> 00:07:05,579
Why are you here?

145
00:07:09,420 --> 00:07:10,420
Why?

146
00:07:10,959 --> 00:07:11,959
Don't get us wrong.

147
00:07:12,300 --> 00:07:15,480
He and I were just
reading stories in bed.

148
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:18,000
I heard everything.

149
00:07:18,660 --> 00:07:21,199
You got close to me and treated me well

150
00:07:22,019 --> 00:07:23,639
just to rip out my heart

151
00:07:24,180 --> 00:07:25,319
for this old scum!

152
00:07:26,519 --> 00:07:27,800
Since you heard everything,

153
00:07:28,639 --> 00:07:30,120
I won't hide it anymore.

154
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:32,160
I got close to you

155
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:34,819
just to take your Pure Heart.

156
00:07:35,220 --> 00:07:37,139
You vile woman!

157
00:07:37,459 --> 00:07:39,959
Guards, seize him.

158
00:07:42,759 --> 00:07:43,759
Let me go!

159
00:07:44,759 --> 00:07:45,879
Lin Weiyu!

160
00:07:46,199 --> 00:07:47,259
Old scum!

161
00:07:47,819 --> 00:07:49,240
You're all monsters!

162
00:07:49,519 --> 00:07:50,959
You'll pay for this!

163
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:53,579
The time has come. Take him away.

164
00:07:53,740 --> 00:07:54,740
Make preparation.

165
00:07:54,740 --> 00:07:55,279
- Yes!
- Yes!

166
00:07:55,279 --> 00:07:56,899
You'll pay for this!

167
00:07:58,319 --> 00:07:59,319
Let me go!

168
00:08:00,420 --> 00:08:02,939
I can hardly wait

169
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:07,339
to enjoy that young, vibrant heart.

170
00:08:28,148 --> 00:08:31,739
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

171
00:08:31,739 --> 00:08:34,526
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

172
00:08:35,102 --> 00:08:37,264
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

173
00:08:37,264 --> 00:08:40,110
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

174
00:08:40,110 --> 00:08:43,388
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

175
00:08:43,388 --> 00:08:45,022
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

176
00:08:45,022 --> 00:08:47,086
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

177
00:08:47,086 --> 00:08:48,622
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

178
00:08:48,622 --> 00:08:51,404
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

179
00:08:51,853 --> 00:08:53,758
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

180
00:08:53,758 --> 00:08:59,789
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

181
00:09:00,371 --> 00:09:04,254
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

182
00:09:04,254 --> 00:09:07,479
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

183
00:09:07,991 --> 00:09:10,590
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

184
00:09:10,590 --> 00:09:15,718
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

185
00:09:15,718 --> 00:09:19,246
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

186
00:09:19,246 --> 00:09:22,954
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

187
00:09:22,954 --> 00:09:24,846
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

188
00:09:24,846 --> 00:09:26,923
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

189
00:09:26,923 --> 00:09:29,454
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

190
00:09:29,454 --> 00:09:33,491
♪You met the most precious person♪

191
00:09:35,159 --> 00:09:37,022
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

192
00:09:37,022 --> 00:09:39,541
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

193
00:09:39,541 --> 00:09:40,990
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

194
00:09:40,990 --> 00:09:43,292
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

195
00:09:43,292 --> 00:09:45,262
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

196
00:09:45,262 --> 00:09:49,672
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

197
00:09:49,672 --> 00:09:51,214
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

198
00:09:51,214 --> 00:09:53,124
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

199
00:09:53,124 --> 00:09:56,398
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

200
00:09:56,398 --> 00:09:59,719
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

201
00:09:59,719 --> 00:10:01,454
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

202
00:10:01,454 --> 00:10:06,078
♪Just catch your breath first♪

203
00:10:06,078 --> 00:10:09,828
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

204
00:10:09,828 --> 00:10:13,206
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

205
00:10:13,580 --> 00:10:15,550
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

206
00:10:15,550 --> 00:10:21,297
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

207
00:10:21,297 --> 00:10:24,813
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

208
00:10:24,813 --> 00:10:26,382
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

209
00:10:26,382 --> 00:10:28,692
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

210
00:10:28,692 --> 00:10:30,430
♪From laughter to devotion♪

211
00:10:30,430 --> 00:10:32,486
♪From falling to innocence♪

212
00:10:32,486 --> 00:10:34,334
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

213
00:10:34,334 --> 00:10:41,004
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
